{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒里奈...いこまりな...いかまりな...いかまりね...イカマリネ！！という設楽さんが考えてくださった懐かしい生駒の自己紹介ギャグを覚えている方は居るのだろうか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこ...懐かしい...あれはまだスタジオが...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という話ではなく今回は生駒では無く、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私 若月がワカマリネさんですという。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/10/04/2221386/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"調和と強調...むしろ協調。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大事な事や課題は沢山あるんですけどね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろ 考え方変えようと思って。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分というもののスペックに合わせて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"得意不得意を知って、どんな魅せ方が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の表現の仕方に合っているのかとか..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"技量も場数もまだまだ全然無いから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"背伸びしても 埋められない隙間が見え隠れするから 無理は辞めようって考えに至りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演じ過ぎないように...必死にならないように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"といいつつも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目標や目指す場所は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の中でちゃんと高くに置いておりますので。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マリネという役に対してはいっぱい考えましたし、色々試行錯誤しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ 私は力が入り過ぎる癖があるので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の1番の目標は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月のお芝居が好きだ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周りとちゃんと馴染んでた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思ってもらえるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の私に出来る最大限 頑張ろうと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しむことと挑戦を忘れないで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々な事を恐れずに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分を信じて 勉強してきますっ ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、行って参ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/10/04/2221386/0001.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}